RESIDUES SEEN BUT NOT CHASED (measured, each on a pass-3 witness):
  * w.sv — a NO-ARGUMENT constant-foldable package function called as a
    cont-assign rhs: golden replaces the call with the FUNCTION BODY's own
    constant object (it keeps that literal's location and BIN form); we mint a
    fresh UINT:0 with no location.
  * v.sv/w.sv — we emit an EXTRA ref_typespec on a func-call ARGUMENT's ref_obj
    that golden does not carry.  Same class as ranked residue (1).
  * x.sv — a continuous assignment whose rhs is a constant-foldable BARE
    replication (`assign r2 = {(PW){1'b0}};`) FOLDS to a BIN constant carrying a
    ref_typespec in golden's ELAB view; we keep the operation.  Def view right.
  * y.sv — a based literal followed by ALIGNMENT WHITESPACE (`'h3    : a`)
    shortens the enclosing operation's END COLUMN in golden by exactly the run
    of spaces; the compact spelling agrees.  Span-only, cmp-irrelevant.
  * s.sv/u.sv/w.sv — direct-literal CONSTANT PARENTING inside a def-view concat
    is inverted vs golden in both views (we parent where golden does not and
    vice versa).  cmp-irrelevant, byte-identity only.

